    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Grounded telegraf series",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 36,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Series below come from the per-bridge telegraf remote-write (`apps/bridge/assets/telegraf/owned-devices.conf.njk`, output configured in `devenv/modules/spoke.nix`). Telegraf's prometheus naming is `<measurement>_<field>`; a field named `value` collapses to the bare measurement name. Grounded prefixes: `icmp_reachable|icmp_loss_ratio|icmp_response_seconds` {device_id}; chassis `sensor_temperature_celsius|sensor_fan_rpm|sensor_fan_percent|sensor_voltage_volts|sensor_psu_watts|chassis_power_watts` {device_id, sensor}; `gpu_temperature_celsius|gpu_memory_temperature_celsius|gpu_power_watts|gpu_memory_power_watts` {device_id, gpu_index}; PDU `pdu_*` fields + `pdu_inlet_*|pdu_phase_*|pdu_breaker_*|pdu_line_*|pdu_outlet_*|pdu_outlet_switch_*|pdu_bank_*|pdu_temp_*|pdu_thd_*` tables {device_id, pdu_vendor, name, index}; CDU `cdu_*` (see `cdu-measurements.ts`) {device_id, pump/reservoir/detector/psu}. All series carry global tags bridge_id + zone."
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "BMC unreachable devices",
      "description": "Devices whose latest ICMP probe (icmp_reachable) is 0.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 40,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "count(icmp_reachable == 0) or vector(0)"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"]
        },
        "graphMode": "area",
        "colorMode": "value"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
